#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: buildVars.py:20
msgid "Markdown Navigator"
msgstr "Markdown 导航"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:23
msgid ""
"An NVDA add-on that provides structured navigation (headings, lists, tables, "
"etc.) in editable text areas for Markdown files."
msgstr "一个 NVDA 插件，为 Markdown 文件提供结构化导航（标题、列表、表格等）。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:28
msgid ""
"### 1.0.1\n"
"\n"
"- Improved Markdown list navigation (L / Shift+L) to include nested lists, "
"and ignored list-like content inside fenced code blocks (``` / ~~~) during "
"list and block-boundary navigation.\n"
msgstr ""
"### 1.0.1\n"
"\n"
"- 改进 Markdown 列表导航（L / Shift+L），支持跳转到嵌套列表，并在列表与块边界"
"导航时忽略代码块（``` / ~~~）内类似列表的内容。\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "### 1.0.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Added extended Markdown table navigation for the first and last rows "
#~ "and columns.\n"
#~ "- Added row and column reading commands, including reading from the "
#~ "current cell to the end of an axis.\n"
#~ "- Reused NVDA text navigation APIs so native table and editor behavior "
#~ "remains available.\n"
#~ "- Added a public integration hook for Easy Table Navigator in Markdown "
#~ "tables. (Once Easy Table Navigator PR #23 is merged, its arrow-key and "
#~ "edge-navigation commands will work with Markdown Navigator tables.)\n"
#~ "- Fixed list navigation across continuation paragraphs, nested lists, "
#~ "list boundaries, and documents without a trailing newline.\n"
#~ "- Added Markdown link activation with Space, Enter, and Numpad Enter, "
#~ "including internal anchor jumps and external URL opening.\n"
#~ "- Added NVDA+K support for reporting the destination of the Markdown link "
#~ "at the caret.\n"
#~ "- Added support for opening existing absolute local Markdown link "
#~ "targets.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "### 1.0.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- 新增 Markdown 表格首行、末行、首列和末列导航。\n"
#~ "- 新增表格行列朗读功能，包括从当前单元格朗读至所在行列末尾。\n"
#~ "- 复用 NVDA 文本导航 API，保留原生表格和编辑器行为。\n"
#~ "- 增加供 Easy Table Navigator 在 Markdown 表格中使用的公开集成接口。\n"
#~ "（待 Easy Table Navigator PR #23 合并后，可在 Markdown Navigator 表格中使"
#~ "用其方向键和边界导航命令。）\n"
#~ "- 修复跨连续段落、嵌套列表、列表边界以及无末尾换行文档中的列表导航。\n"
#~ "- 支持使用空格、回车和数字键盘回车激活 Markdown 链接，包括内部锚点跳转和外"
#~ "部网址打开。\n"
#~ "- 支持使用 NVDA+K 读出光标所在 Markdown 链接的目标地址。\n"
#~ "- 支持打开已存在的本地绝对路径 Markdown 链接。\n"

